  partName: Intake Runner
  description: The Intake Runner, located at the middle-center-front of the engine,
    is a medium-sized, elongated, accent-yellow component that plays a crucial role
    in directing air into the engine's combustion chamber. Its shape and position
    allow for optimal airflow, which is essential for efficient engine performance.
    Interestingly, the Intake Runner's accent-yellow color helps to distinguish it
    from other components during maintenance and inspection.
